{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Last Guild is a classic third-person RPG with turn-based combat! Powerful beings are rising, and the Kingdom is counting on the last guild to exterminate the forces of darkness. Do you have what it takes to restore order to the world? Choose your adventurers to help restore peace and order to the Kingdom! The Last Guild blends classic RPG heritage with other innovative mechanics, creating an RPG experience like no other! The game will feature several adventures as if it had a GM narrating classic RPG campaigns, from which the player will benefit from new content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701320/extras/Bar1.png?t=1746191154\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701320/extras/GiffCombat.gif?t=1746191154\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The combats are intense and turn-based. Develop your strategies to defeat dozens of unique enemies and deadly bosses. If you defeat them, you will obtain special rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701320/extras/Bar2.png?t=1746191154\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701320/extras/GiffSkill.gif?t=1746191154\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You can build up their characters by acquiring EXP and enabling their skills and equipping them with powerful items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701320/extras/Bar3.png?t=1746191154\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701320/extras/GiffExploration.gif?t=1746191154\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the region in search of resources for item creation. Guild quests are essential to obtain many resources!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3701320?t=1746191154","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3701320?t=1746191154","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701320/7c250e8df5609175ba44bf2b576298c26ee4a652/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746191154","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701320/7c250e8df5609175ba44bf2b576298c26ee4a652/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746191154","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Last Guild is a classic third-person RPG with turn-based combat! Powerful beings are rising, and the Kingdom is counting on the last guild to exterminate the forces of darkness. Do you have what it takes to restore order to the world? Choose your adventurers to help restore peace and order to the Kingdom! The Last Guild blends classic RPG heritage with other innovative mechanics, creating an RPG experience like no other! The game will feature several adventures as if it had a GM narrating classic RPG campaigns, from which the player will benefit from new content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701320/extras/Bar1.png?t=1746191154\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701320/extras/GiffCombat.gif?t=1746191154\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The combats are intense and turn-based. Develop your strategies to defeat dozens of unique enemies and deadly bosses. If you defeat them, you will obtain special rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701320/extras/Bar2.png?t=1746191154\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701320/extras/GiffSkill.gif?t=1746191154\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You can build up their characters by acquiring EXP and enabling their skills and equipping them with powerful items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701320/extras/Bar3.png?t=1746191154\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701320/extras/GiffExploration.gif?t=1746191154\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the region in search of resources for item creation. Guild quests are essential to obtain many resources!</p>","developers":["WKM-STUDIO"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701320/d44f03105d2150229d6bf8de3ede1a995d6b4dfb/header.jpg?t=1746191154","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133051,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133051/movie480.mp4?t=17459